      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write an improved version of the test with better understandability: removing unused imports and grouping assertions by scenario with explanatory comments.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removing six unused imports (`assertFalse`, `assertNotNull`, `assertNull`, `assertTrue`, `Constructor`, `Modifier`) and grouping the assertions into four logical clusters with inline comments explaining the scenario each group covers (null inputs, empty string, null/empty set, and actual character counting with range patterns)."
